        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-171, Trumbull Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery little in door hardware has the versatility of the Trumbull Cabinet Knob. It is available in and array finish combinations (click on picture to the right to see them all) and each one of them seem to transform this cabinet handle into something different. The cafe bronze finish gives the impression of leather for a rustic feel while the two-toned polished nickel and black grants this cabinet door knob a very on-trend look perfect for modern spaces. Part of RK International's Trumbull Collection, the Rectangular Trumbull Cabinet Knob comes packaged with all necessary installation hardware. It measures 1-9/16 inches by 1-3/16 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/trumbull-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-671\"><b>Trumbull Cabinet Pull</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/trumbull-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6671\"><b>Trumbull Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-171 Rectangular Trumbull Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-12-specifications.gif?v=1704354508\" width=\"590\" height=\"88\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
